# Design-tool exports — large, contain licensed fonts and raw screenshots.
# What matters from them is extracted into tokens/illustrations and committed;
# the raw bundle stays local like the captures. See docs/DECISIONS.md D-013.
design-kit/reference/exports/
# Agency portal templates: built from signed-in, fixture-redacted captures (D-011).
# Desktop only — dubizzle Pro has no mobile layout (D-012). Local, like my-ads/chat.
design-kit/templates/desktop/portal-*.html
