# Remotion skills installed via `npx skills add` — kept local, not part of the
# design-system repo. Remove this block (and commit .agents/) if you decide to
# keep them; or `rm -rf .agents skills-lock.json .claude/skills/remotion-*` to drop them.
.agents/
skills-lock.json
.claude/skills/remotion-*

